Garmin refuses the favorites read of an account without Garmin Connect+ with 403 ForbiddenException. The message names the plan, and the exit code stays 1 (error) with status 403.
-- args --
nutrition
favorites
remove
1001
-- route GET /nutrition-service/favorite?start=0&limit=50&includeContent=true 403 noeol --
{"message":"HTTP 403 Forbidden","error":"ForbiddenException"}
-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
list favorite foods: this needs a Garmin Connect+ subscription (403 Forbidden)
-- table exit --
1
-- table requests --
GET /nutrition-service/favorite?start=0&limit=50&includeContent=true
